supralinux-settings (0.1.0~dev2) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Add a baloo_file compatibility launcher for Plasma File Search on the
    Ubuntu 26.04 base. Plasma 6.6.6 resolves baloo_file through PATH when the
    KCM enables indexing, while Ubuntu's baloo6 package installs the daemon in
    KDE's multiarch libexec directory.
  * Resolve the real baloo6-owned daemon from the dpkg manifest at runtime and
    exec it directly, without adding private libexec directories to session
    PATH or hard-coding an architecture triplet.

 -- SupraLINUX Project <noreply@supralinux.com>  Fri, 28 Aug 2026 20:45:00 -0300

supralinux-settings (0.1.0~dev1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial development package for persistent SupraLINUX defaults.
  * Configure the SDDM greeter to run on KWin Wayland using KDE's Plasma
    Wayland greeter integration.
  * Keep XWayland available through the Plasma Wayland stack for legacy X11
    application compatibility; this package does not disable X11 libraries or
    compatibility components.

 -- SupraLINUX Project <noreply@supralinux.com>  Thu, 27 Aug 2026 01:20:00 -0300
